Board acknowledges the significance of robust cybersecurity management programs and actively participates in overseeing and reviewing
our cybersecurity risk profile and exposures.</ix:nonNumeric></span> At Rafael AI, where our business has particular cybersecurity requirements, we have in-house
security engineers responsible for end-to-end internal governance over corporate cybersecurity, data security, and AI-model-related security.
<span id="xdx_905_ecyd--CybersecurityRiskManagementThirdPartyEngagedFlag_dbT_c20250501__20260430_zNqJw8v8GP9k" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtIEN5YmVyc2VjdXJpdHkgUmlzayBNYW5hZ2VtZW50IGFuZCBTdHJhdGVneSBEaXNjbG9zdXJlAA__"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-05-01to2026-04-30" format="ixt:booleantrue" id="Fact000054" name="cyd:CybersecurityRiskManagementThirdPartyEngagedFlag">Professional third-party security vendors are retained to support the delivery of cybersecurity-related activities.</ix:nonNumeric></span> Given the size and
