of a deferred tax liability of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedDeferredTaxLiabilities_iI_pn5n6_c20260130__us-gaap--BusinessAcquisitionAxis__custom--AberfeldyHoldingsLimitedMember_zaIkgUIuapBj" title="Deferred tax liability"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:BusinessCombinationRecognizedIdentifiableAssetsAcquiredAndLiabilitiesAssumedDeferredTaxLiabilities" contextRef="AsOf2026-01-30_custom_AberfeldyHoldingsLimitedMember" id="Fact001006" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">21.6</ix:nonFraction></span> million arising from book and tax basis differences generated upon the acquisition.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"></span></p>

